{"sourceUrl":"https://gs.imr.ac.cn/zs/zs_sszs/zs_sszs_tzgg/202608/t20260824_854503.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:25.348024+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://gs.imr.ac.cn/zs/zs_sszs/zs_sszs_tzgg/202608/t20260824_854503.html","html":"<div>\n<div><p><span><span><span><span>接收推荐免试生遵循公平公正、全面衡量、保证质量、择优录取、宁缺毋滥的原则。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>全日制</span><span>2027</span><span>届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>有志于科学研究事业，有较好的科研潜力，道德品质良好，遵纪守法，在校期间没有受过纪律处分；</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>申请人学习成绩优异；</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>具有较强的外语听、说、读、写应用能力；</span></p><p><span>5.</span><span>具有较强的调查研究、综合分析问题、解决问题能力；</span></p><p><span>6.</span><span>身心健康，身体健康符合规定的体检标准；</span></p><p><span>7.</span><span>材料、化学、物理、加工、机械<span>、环境、能源、电子、数学、人工智能</span>等相关学科生源。</span></p><div><p><span><span><span><span><span>二、申请材料</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>推荐免试申请者应直接向我所研究生</span></span><span><span><span>部</span></span></span><span><span>提交如下材料：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（一）必须提供材料</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>个人简历<span>；</span></span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span>所在学校教务部门（或院系）出具并</span><span><strong>加盖公章</strong></span><span>的大学本科前三年所修课程成绩单</span><span><strong>原件</strong></span><span>扫描件<span>；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>．</span></span><span><span><span><strong>加盖公章</strong></span></span></span><span><span>的总评成绩专业排名证明</span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>．国家英语四、六级及其他英语等级证书</span></span><span><span><span><strong>原件</strong></span></span></span><span><span>扫描件</span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>．身份证扫描件。</span></span></span></span></p><div><p><span><span><span><span>（二）自愿提供材料</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>．大学期间的获奖证书扫描件</span></span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>．在公开发行的学术刊物或全国性学术会议上发表的学术论文、所获专利或其它原创性工作成果的复印件或证明扫描件。</span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://gs.imr.ac.cn/zs/zs_sszs/zs_sszs_tzgg/202608/t20260824_854503.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span><span><span><span>三、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>报名</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>程序</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>报名日期：</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>25</span><span>日</span><span>-2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>报名链接：</span><span><a href=\"https://gsywmobi.imr.ac.cn/#/pages/recruit/index\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://gsywmobi.imr.ac.cn/#/pages/recruit/index</span></a></span><span><span></span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>审核及接收：材料审核和接收工作由研究生<span>部</span>负责。入选者将会收到电话<span>、短信或邮件</span>通知，考核时间初定为</span><span>9</span><span>月<span>中</span>旬，具体时间、考核方式、安排等事项另行通知，未接到通知者视为未能入选。</span></p></div><div><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>注：已通过我所线上研学体验营或线下大学生科研实践项目中综合素质评价的同学无需再次申请。</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span><span><span>张</span></span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></span></span><span><span>024-8397</span></span><span><span><span>8851/23971267</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>tzhang</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>@imr.ac.cn</span></span></span></span></p></div></div></div>\n</div>","textSha256":"2654c5482c936ac01f56dd3a8b0e3689af1566c122c7b2ad96e776fa7ab33ecf","textLength":719,"sourceSha256":"c93b7e5ac3eda5fb02827d8ab9f3851e97a6f99d09e85c0d8b6c4f972ea456a2","selector":"article-like:doc-content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5106e0282c304ec25afa","title":"2026年中国科学技术大学材料科学与工程学院2027年接收推免生的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:25.348024+00:00"}
